les\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player's starting position|1|1\r\n3|Block|Movable blocks by the player|4|4\r\n4|Target|Tiles to which the \"Block\" tile need to be moved to solve the level. There **must** be the EXACT same amount, or the level becomes unsolvable|4|4\r\n", "Width": "5", "Height": "5", "GameType": "Top Down", "GameGenre": "Puzzle", "DifficultyLevel": "Medium", "HazardLevel": "None", "CustomConstraints": "The level solution length **must** be at least 10 steps\n\nThe level **must** be solvable by an A* agent", "TemplateFilePath": "PromptV2.hbs"}, "sokoban-v0_1": {"GameName": "Sokoban", "GameDescription": "Sokoban is an old Japanese block pushing game that inspired a lot of games like Baba is You and game engines like PuzzleScript", "LevelName": "sokoban-v0", "LevelDescription": "", "Tiles": "\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player's starting position|1|1\r\n3|Block|Movable blocks by the player|4|4\r\n4|Target|Tiles to which the \"Block\" tile need to be moved to solve the level. There **must** be the EXACT same amount, or the level becomes unsolvable|4|4\r\n", "Width": "5", "Height": "5", "GameType": "Top Down", "GameGenre": "Puzzle", "DifficultyLevel": "Medium", "HazardLevel": "None", "CustomConstraints": "The level solution length **must** be at least 10 steps\n\nThe level **must** be solvable by an A* agent", "TemplateFilePath": "PromptV2.hbs"}, "sokoban-v0_2": {"GameName": "Sokoban", "GameDescription": "Sokoban is an old Japanese block pushing game that inspired a lot of games like Baba is You and game engines like PuzzleScript", "LevelName": "sokoban-v0", "LevelDescription": "", "Tiles": "\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid