e the level. There **must** be the EXACT same amount, or the level becomes unsolvable|1|1\r\n", "Width": "8", "Height": "8", "GameType": "Top Down", "GameGenre": "Puzzle", "DifficultyLevel": "Medium", "HazardLevel": "None", "CustomConstraints": "The level solution length **must** be at least 48 steps\n\nThe level **must** be solvable by an A* agent", "TemplateFilePath": "PromptV2.hbs"}, "sokoban-large-v0_7": {"GameName": "Sokoban", "GameDescription": "Sokoban is an old Japanese block pushing game that inspired a lot of games like Baba is You and game engines like PuzzleScript", "LevelName": "sokoban-large-v0", "LevelDescription": "", "Tiles": "\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Wall|Solid impassable wall||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Player|The player's starting position|1|1\r\n3|Block|Movable blocks by the player|1|1\r\n4|Target|Tiles to which the \"Block\" tile need to be moved to solve the level. There **must** be the EXACT same amount, or the level becomes unsolvable|1|1\r\n", "Width": "8", "Height": "8", "GameType": "Top Down", "GameGenre": "Puzzle", "DifficultyLevel": "Medium", "HazardLevel": "None", "CustomConstraints": "The level solution length **must** be at least 48 steps\n\nThe level **must** be solvable by an A* agent", "TemplateFilePath": "PromptV2.hbs"}, "mario-v0_0": {"GameName": "Super Mario Bros", "GameDescription": "Super Mario Bros. is a platform game in which the player controls the titular protagonist Mario, who is tasked with exploring the Mushroom Kingdom to defeat Bowser and rescue Princess Toadstool. His brother, Luigi, is controlled by the second player in multiplayer mode and assumes the same plot role and functionality as Mario.\u200a The game takes place through a side-scrolling perspective where the player moves to the right to reach the flagpole at the end of each level.", "LevelName": "smbtile-v0", "LevelDescription": "", "Tiles": "\r\nTile Character|Tile Name|Tile Description|Minimum Number Of Tile|Maximum Number Of Tiles\r\n---|---|---|---|---\r\n0|Empty|Background tile||\r\n1|Floor|Walkable floor||\r\n2|Ladder|Solid ladder tile||\r\n3|Breakable Brick|Tile that can be destroyed when bumped from beneath and Mario is not in small form||\r\n4|Question Mark Block|Tile that contains a special surprise (power-up) when bumped from beneath||\r\n5|Tube|Used as platforms or \"tunnels\" to other sub-levels. Must form a single solid vertical column exactly 2 tiles wide, occupying the same 2 columns in every row of its height, resting flush on the ground with no floating segments or gaps||\r\n6|Coin|Collectible coin|0|15\r\n7|Gomba|Enemy which dies from jumping on top of them||\r\n8|Koopa|Enemy which when it dies from jumping on top of them, they will proceed to leave a shell which will move horizontally and bounce back and forth on wall||\r\n9|Spiny|Enemy which cannot be killed from jumping on top of them||\r\n", "Width": "150", "Height": "16", "GameType": "Side Scroller", "GameGenre": "Platform", "DifficultyLevel": "Medium", "HazardLevel": "Easy", "CustomConstraints": "The level **must** have unbroken pipes: each pipe is a single solid vertical rectangle exactly 2 tiles wide, occupying the exact same 2 columns in every row of its height, with no horizontal offset between rows (no staggered or zig-zag pipes) and no gaps within the column\n\nEvery pipe **must** rest directly on the ground/floor, with its bottom row flush against a solid floor tile; a pipe must never float in the air disconnected from the ground\n\nThe level **must** have 50% or more of just flat platform to comply with mario distribution of tiles\n\nThere **must** not be \"floating\" enemies\n\nThe level **must** be solvable by an A* agent\n\nThe level **must** have between 0 and 30 jumps \n\nThe total number of enemies **must always** be between 0 and 21", "TemplateFilePath": "PromptV2.hbs"}, "mario-v0_1": {"GameName": "Super Mario Bros", "GameDesc